      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i testing build1003.\nThe worst situation is avoided and it seems to be improving to some extent, but it feels like it's forcing the ankles to be on their outer thighs, despite the gender setting.\n(If there's a problem with the position of the ankle bones, they twist.)\nWith the maintenance of the AV3 and the IK system, it seems difficult to make any improvements, but I'd like to see as much improvement as possible.\nadd screenshot\nmenu pose is true pose\nI think, to begin with, the idle motion specified for IK may be wrong, and the user may not be able to specify it in the first place.",
